      "Operators start, pause and finish routing operations from a touch or mobile client or in BC",
      "Exposes operators, machine and work centers and scrap reasons via API pages",
      "Records timestamps plus produced and scrapped quantities for each action",
      "Rebuilds actual active time across pauses",
      "Fills and posts the standard output journal automatically",
